---@field trigger string What started the run: 'opened', 'ready_for_review', 'verdict:<outcome>' or 'safety_net'.
---@field scope posthog.stamphog.RoutingScopeEnum 'full', or 'pinned' when a stamphog approval asked only the owners of sensitive and new paths. * `full` - Every owner * `pinned` - Pinned owners only
---@field fork? boolean Whether the pull request came from a fork, which skips the model.
---@field llm_skipped posthog.stamphog.LlmSkipReasonEnum|distilled.Null Why the cut step made no model call. Null when it made one. * `single_candidate` - Single candidate * `fork` - Fork * `nothing_cuttable` - Nothing cuttable * `no_answer` - No answer * `stamphog_approved` - Stamphog approved * `files_truncated` - Files truncated
---@field model? string The model the cut request reached. Blank when no request reached the gateway.
