---The run's decision for every owner of the changed code, with the files each owner owns.
---@alias posthog.stamphog.StamphogRoutingRunDetailOwnersList posthog.stamphog.StamphogRoutingRunOwnerDetail[]

---@class posthog.stamphog.StamphogRoutingRunOwner
---@field outcome posthog.stamphog.RoutingOwnerOutcomeEnum What the run did with the owner: 'requested', 'labeled' (a fork label instead of a request), 'refused' (GitHub refused the request or the label), 'cut', 'not_requested' (stamphog approved and the owner is not pinned) or 'already_requested' (an earlier run asked this pinned owner). * `requested` - Requested * `labeled` - Labeled * `refused` - Refused by GitHub * `cut` - Cut * `not_requested` - Not requested * `already_requested` - Already requested
---@field reason posthog.stamphog.RoutingOwnerReasonEnum Why: 'sensitive' or 'new_path' (pinned, never cut), 'largest_owner' (a pull request keeps at least one reviewer), 'diff_not_seen' (the model did not see all of the owner's diff), 'cut_skipped' (no model call, see llm_skipped on the run), 'model_kept', 'model_cut' or 'stamphog_approved'. * `sensitive` - Owns a sensitive path * `new_path` - Owns a new path * `largest_owner` - Has the largest part * `diff_not_seen` - Diff not shown to the model * `cut_skipped` - Cut step skipped * `model_kept` - Kept by the model * `model_cut` - Cut by the model * `stamphog_approved` - Stamphog approved
---@field pins posthog.stamphog.StamphogRoutingRunOwnerPinsList The changed paths that pinned the owner, so no cut could remove them.
---@field kind posthog.stamphog.OwnerKindEnum Whether the owner is a GitHub team or a person. * `team` - Team * `person` - Person
---@field owner string The owner as owners.yaml spells it: a team slug such as 'team-devex', or a GitHub login such as '@octocat'.
---@field model_reason? string The model's one-line reason to cut this owner. Also set when a guard kept the owner anyway. Blank when the model proposed no cut for them.
---@field lines? number Changed lines in the files this owner owns.
---@field file_count? number Changed files this owner owns.

---@class posthog.stamphog.StamphogRoutingRunOwnerDetail
