---@field files posthog.stamphog.StamphogRoutingRunOwnerDetailFilesList Every changed file this owner owns, which is what made them a candidate. Patches are not kept.
---@field owner string The owner as owners.yaml spells it: a team slug such as 'team-devex', or a GitHub login such as '@octocat'.
---@field model_reason? string The model's one-line reason to cut this owner. Also set when a guard kept the owner anyway. Blank when the model proposed no cut for them.
---@field lines? number Changed lines in the files this owner owns.
---@field file_count? number Changed files this owner owns.

